==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{der|sv|non|þorp}}, from {{der|sv|gem-pro|*þurpą}}, whence also with {{cog|de|Dorf}} and {{cog|nl|dorp}}.

===Noun===
{{sv-noun|n}}

# {{lb|sv|before 16th century}} A solitary [[farm]], distant from other settlements.
# {{lb|sv|16th century}} ''Officially defined'' as a very small farm.
# {{lb|sv|17th century to early 20th century}} A farm, [[rent]]ed from a larger [[land owner]], where the rent was paid through work on the owner's land ([[dagsverken]]).
# {{lb|sv|after the 1940's}} A small [[cottage]] in the [[countryside]].

